      "id": "botchan-s11-p0002",
      "source_en": "necessary measures before we do to inflict such severe punishment upon them as to make them unable to appear in the educational world again.\" Every word was italicized to call the special attention of the reader. Thus the poor pressmen of the local paper thought that they had applied to us the hot moxa (had punished us). \"Damn it!\" cried I and sprang out of bed in an instant. Wonderful to say, the pain I had felt in the joints was so greatly alleviated that I forgot it as soon as I left my bed.",
